<title>NEW ZEALAND: Utilicorp bids $8 a share for five pct of Power NZ.</title>
<headline>Utilicorp bids $8 a share for five pct of Power NZ.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Utilicorp New Zealand said on Friday it would offer $8 a share for up to five percent of Power NZ under the terms of a restricted transfer notice.</p>
<p>The offer is for up to 7,573,511 shares in Power NZ.</p>
<p>Utilicorp said the notice was given in addition to, and without prejudice to its June 12, 1995 offer and would not affect that offer.</p>
<p>It said the acquisition would be made on and from September 20, 1996 and remain open until October 25 unless extended by Utilicorp NZ.</p>
</text>
